August 3rd, then the governor can call a special election in November to fill the seat. We a get a Republican who votes for the SAVE act.\n\nHowever, it's possible that the governor could challenge the 2024 law (special elections to fill vacant seats) to say it's unconstitutional to Kentucky's constitution and try to appoint a Democrat for the remaining few months. Which then is settled by Kentucky's supreme court, which is Democrat majority. This outcome is very shady, but we are talking about Democrats.\n\nGiven all of this, McConnell is probably trying to fuck Republicans one last time and therefore will step down on August 4th or soon thereafter so that the seat remains vacant until the new term. One last \"fuck you\" to the SAVE act and America.", "author": "madisonmaga", "created": 1785581879414, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "stealthboy", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "McConnell - Important Date August 3rd", "last_comment_created": 1785584380105, "content": "<p>August 3rd is the cutoff date to call a special election to fill McConnell's senate seat. If he steps down after August 3rd, then his seat goes vacant until the new term.</p>\n<p>If he steps down on August 3rd, then the governor can call a special election in November to fill the seat. We a get a Republican who votes for the SAVE act.</p>\n<p>However, it's possible that the governor could challenge the 2024 law (special elections to fill vacant seats) to say it's unconstitutional to Kentucky's constitution and try to appoint a Democrat for the remaining few months. Which then is settled by Kentucky's supreme court, which is Democrat majority. This outcome is very shady, but we are talking about Democrats.</p>\n<p>Given all of this, McConnell is probably trying to fuck Republicans one last time and therefore will step down on August 4th or soon thereafter so that the seat remains vacant until the new term. One last &quot;fuck you&quot; to the SAVE act and America.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 7, "score_up": 40, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATC4mbrdN", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 32, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8758125, "raw_content": "", "author": "RandomDude25", "created": 1785586057971, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "CliffordClaven", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "media.scored.co", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATC4mbrdN.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://media.scored.co/post/BvzbOcXDc5AF.jpeg", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [{"reference": "/scale/ksLyAGC6vcROUKSb.jpeg", "width": 564, "content-type": "jpeg", "height": 768}], "blurhash": "UDGlL@9F4n~q_39Fj[%Mx]-;M{IU00xu%MD%", "full_resolution": [2068, 1518]}, "title": "A villain origin story.", "last_comment_created": 1785588486350, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": true, "comments": 1, "score_up": 32, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2083256697670304207", "sticky_comment": 0, 